{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 MEGA FANTASY Walking NPC and Faces</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This asset pack was created under the limitations of the classic \u201c9-bit color\u201d (512 colors) used in old 16-bit home consoles, with color palettes restricted to 15 colors per palette.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 256 Walking and Face Graphic Variations for NPCs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The set includes 48 humanoid characters and 16 animals, each with 4 variations. <br>(48 + 16) \u00d7 4 = <strong>256 total patterns</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variations range from simple color swaps to different clothing designs and skin tones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speech bubble assets are also included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Contents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters: 40 sheet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faces:32 sheet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System:1 sheet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis pack is for use in RPG Maker Series or the engine of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOK to be used in Commercial projects made in RPG Maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou may modify some of the assets (but not redistribute them) for your own game use only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912550?t=1755133897","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912550?t=1755133897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912550/64f6b9798842978883b5d6dd33cbac032086dcd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755133897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912550/64f6b97988429788